<mjml>
    <mj-head>
        <mj-attributes>
            <mj-all font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" />
            <mj-text color="#353333" font-size="16px" />
            <mj-button background-color="#3472ed" color="#ffffff" />
        </mj-attributes>
    </mj-head>

    <mj-body background-color="#f4f6fb">

        <!-- Header -->
        <mj-section background-color="#3472ed" padding="30px">
            <mj-column>
                <mj-image
                    src="https://edgecdnx.fra1.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/public/Logo%20Transparency%20white.png"
                    alt="Logo" width="250px" align="center" />
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <!-- Main Content -->
        <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="30px">
            <mj-column>
                <mj-text font-size="18px" color="#353333" line-height="1.6">

                    <section style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;">
                        <h2 style="color: #1E90FF;">March updates - EdgeCDN-X</h2>
                        <h4 style="color: #1E90FF;">Try the EdgeCDNX Demo Portal</h4>
                        <p>Curious how EdgeCDNX works in practice? You can now explore a fully functional preview of the
                            platform through the public demo portal.</p>

                        <p>
                            Demo Portal: <a href="https://portal.demo.edgecdnx.com">https://portal.demo.edgecdnx.com</a>
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            The demo environment gives you a hands-on look at the EdgeCDNX control panel and how easy it
                            is to manage content delivery across a global edge network.</p>
                        <p>Please note, the demo deployment only serves 2 regions, and is purely dedicated for testing
                            purposes. </p>
                        <p>I've been trying to figure out how to bootstrap this project as a PaaS solution. I will
                            definitely keep you updated how it goes.</p>
                        <p style="font-weight: bold">
                            If I manage to bootstrap, I will give you a lifetime free access to the production CDN with
                            a generous free plan if you sign up with the demo portal. Feedback is always very
                            appreciated. Feel free to send me a message via the Contact form below or via Cal.com <a
                                href="https://cal.eu/tomas-boros-fbi1fo/30min">link</a>
                        </p>
                    </section>
                </mj-text>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <!-- Video Links -->
        <mj-section background-color="#ffffff">
            <mj-column width="100%">
                <mj-text>
                    Eager to find out more? Feel free to contact us or follow us on one of the socials found in the
                    footer.
                </mj-text>
                <mj-button href="https://n8n.tbotech.sk/form/5e66f7f3-f59e-4973-aa75-26a343a9b0ba"
                    background-color="#3472ed" color="white" border-radius="5px" padding="15px 30px">
                    Contact Me
                </mj-button>
            </mj-column>





        </mj-section>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <mj-section background-color="#353333" padding="20px">
            <mj-column>
                <mj-social mode="horizontal" icon-size="24px" align="center">
                    <mj-social-element name="youtube" href="https://www.youtube.com/@edgecdnx"
                        background-color="#01b1ff" />
                    <mj-social-element name="x" href="https://x.com/EdgecdnX" background-color="#01b1ff" />
                    <mj-social-element name="github" href="https://github.com/EdgeCDN-X" background-color="#01b1ff" />
                </mj-social>

                <mj-text align="center" font-size="12px" color="#ffffff">
                    2026 TboTech s.r.o. - EdgeCDN-X<br></br>Slovakia
                </mj-text>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

    </mj-body>
</mjml>